          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now, you, my brothers and sisters, are God's children as a result of his promise, just as Isaac was. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
