          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So then, my brothers and sisters, we are not the children of a slave woman but of a free woman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.31"
